<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-GUINEA STRIKER CAMARA JOINS MARSEILLE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GUINEA STRIKER CAMARA JOINS MARSEILLE.</headline>
<dateline>MARSEILLE, France 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guinea international striker Aboubacar Camara has signed for Marseille from fellow French first division Lens on a four-year contract worth 12 million francs ($2.1 million), Marseille sources said on Wednesday.</p>
